WEBVTT

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.940
Ah! They've already decorated everything!

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:57.560
What a display of tolerance for our country
to celebrate a foreign festival.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.900
The way you said that is kinda scary.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:04.500
How should we decorate
our Christmas tree?

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:06.260
I'm glad.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.000
Huh?

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:11.060
It seems like I'll get to celebrate Christmas together with you, Yuuna-chan.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.730
Of course you will!

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:17.470
As long as you don't go
off somewhere, Tougou-san.

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:19.330
Oh, come on.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.430
What about me?

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:22.720
Sonocchi?

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:29.500
This will be our first Christmas together, you know?

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.220
It will be all of us together this year!

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:34.330
Let's get fired up for Christmas!

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:39.200
Oh yeah!

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.780
Christ-maaas!

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.950
Mas! Mas!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.720
Hey, Yuuna, is the star crooked?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.730
Nah, it's just fine!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.200
Itsuki, can you take a look too?

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.780
A bit more to the right, maybe?

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.440
That looks good!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.040
Yeah!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.760
What's with those glasses?

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:43.090
She said her eyesight's gotten worse.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:44.960
Those entrance exams are tough, huh?

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.530
You're even studying in
the club room now?

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:51.200
We had our hands full last week,
so there was no time to hit the books.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.000
I have to make up for that.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.100
I apologize!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.000
Hey, come on! That's not
what I was trying to say!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.110
Just drop it already!

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.360
Well, the black hole was more
urgent than the exams.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.190
Yeah...

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.510
I apologize.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:10.070
Correct. Correct. Correct.
Correct, and... correct!
Tougou-san!

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:13.920
All right! And a gold star
for the last problem!

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.230
Fuumin-senpai, you got 100 points!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:18.360
Nice! Way to go, me!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.300
Bonus question!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.320
For what?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.300
Get this one right and your girl power will be doubled.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:24.980
I'm in.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.770
What sort of test are you studying for?

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:30.010
Well, let's leave Fuumin-senpai's
girl power aside for now...

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.020
Not my girl power!

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:35.540
You did well enough to pass. Good job!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.840
Yeah. Thanks for helping me out, Nogi.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.910
Itsuki's show is coming up
next week, you know?

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.680
Oh, so that's why you squeezed
all the studying into this week.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:48.810
Onee-chan, it's not my show! It's a Christmas
event organized by the town!

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.310
The student choir!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.820
It's so amazing that they picked you as our school representative, Itsuki-chan.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.650
It's all because you helped
me practice, Yuuna-san.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.450
It's your own talent. All of it.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:04:59.970
That's the power of your songs, Itsuki.

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:02.100
You're living up to your
name as my sister!

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.840
Show those other schools'
representatives who's boss!

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.700
I think you're missing the point...

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:11.200
You have to be in the best of health
or you might catch a cold.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.550
Health. Health. Health. Health. Health. Health. Health...

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:16.960
Now I'm getting even more nervous!
Health. Health. Health. Health. Health. Health. Health...

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.530
Wanna pop some supplements?

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:19.880
Yeah, give me some that work.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:23.220
Itssun, Itssun! Mind if I launch
a line of Ittsun merch?

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.090
Please stop it!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:29.600
You're acting strange. Is there
something on your mind?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.190
Huh? I'm not thinking
about anything.

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:34.450
That's a problem in
its own right...

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.850
Could it be you're not feeling
well or something?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.610
What was that?! Yuuna-chan doesn't feel well?!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.280
Health.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.020
Yeah, like that'd work...

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.760
Ah, I'm feeling warm and fuzzy.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.860
What, for real?!
There's no way...

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:48.960
Health

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.220
Stop it!

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.290
Health

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.790
I'm starting to feel kinda warm and fuzzy.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:56.550
Hey, what are you doing with my body?!

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:58.040
It's getting hot!

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:04.600
Fuu, help us with the decorations
once you've finished studying!

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.470
Aren't you basically done, anyway?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:12.560
G-Guys, say...

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:16.090
U-Uhm...

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.880
Here's a question for you!

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:22.710
If a grasshopper secretly
took over an ant's debt,

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.940
what problems might arise?

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:28.540
What are you talking about?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:30.300
I don't even know myself.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:31.280
What?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.690
Is that a demonstration problem
for social studies?

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:35.940
Huh?! Uhm...

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.460
I'm trying to come up with a
quiz for the school paper...

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.100
Oh, so that's what it was about.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.290
No way you can use
that in a quiz.

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.210
Like an ant would have
debts in the first place.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.240
Yeah, that's right...

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:50.280
I thought she was just talking nonsense.
Uhm, then...

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.680
Listen, to tell you the truth, when I...

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.580
A quiz about taking over other's debts, huh?

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.340
Ah, yeah...

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:12.260
Maybe we can use the story about the blue oni who
turns himself into a scapegoat for the red oni?

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.420
<i>When I rescued Tougou-san,</i>

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:33.300
<i>I took over her duty.</i>

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:40.160
<i>I'm sure it would worry Tougou-san
if she found out about this.</i>

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:44.270
<i>We're finally together and having fun now!</i>

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.540
<i>I'm...</i>

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:08.300
<i>I'm being kept alive.</i>

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:12.300
<i>That's why I can be here.</i>

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:22.140
Geez. Why would the apartment's heater
break down at a time like this?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.380
The lights suddenly burned out at my place
yesterday; it was very inconvenient.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.840
Seems like you two
had a rough day.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.570
Yeah. It's a tragedy, a tragedy.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.820
That's small time.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:38.610
Itsuki lost the key to the house yesterday
and we had to suffer out in the cold!

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.010
Don't tell them!

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:44.790
We just went to the convenience store
for a bit, but what a disaster!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.690
Geez, you're such a klutz.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:50.070
And I finally thought
she had it together.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.180
Sonoko's finally arrived!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.430
Sonoko-san, your hand!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.800
Oh, it's fine, it's fine.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:04.730
If I cover it with Sancho like so,
it disappears like Schrodinger's cat!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.690
Your hand! It's being eaten!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.990
Seriously, what happened to you?

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.550
I burned myself on a
pot this morning.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.800
Thank goodness you didn't
hurt yourself badly.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.450
Yeah, it's not bad at all.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:19.580
Wow, it looks like all of us seem to
have had a stroke of bad luck.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.950
Maybe the entire Hero Club should
go for an exorcism or something?

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:26.140
Hey, don't say scary stuff like that!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.560
However, we might really need it...

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.650
Hey, don't take me seriously.

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.500
Did anything happen to you, Yuuna-chan?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:31.960
Ah...

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:34.010
No, I'm fine!

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.160
Thank goodness.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:38.730
If something bad were to happen to you too,
then I'd definitely be suspicious.

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:41.810
"It might be the Taisha again!"
or something like that.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.780
No, no, no!

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.460
Yeah, there's no way they'd
do something like that!

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:50.820
You're right.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:54.280
Aren't we getting a
bit <i>too</i> paranoid?

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.900
Okay, okay! Now, now!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.540
All of you, to your posts!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.450
Okay!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.020
U-Uhm, Fuu-senpai!

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.050
Huh?

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:17.300
Do you have a moment?

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.730
What's wrong? Something bothering you?

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:27.310
Uhm... Uhm...

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.840
Is it something about romance?

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.950
Ah, but then Tougou would get angry.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:33.790
She won't get angry.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.280
You sure about that?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.610
That aside, what's up?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:38.790
Tell me.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:43.240
To be honest, recently...

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.330
What do you mean, "recently"?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:48.930
The day we got our smartphones back...

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:50.120
Did something happen?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.840
Actually... Tougou-san was...

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.700
Eh? What about?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:02.010
Um... No...

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.520
Hm?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:12.640
It looks like some important things, like the group picture we took together, are missing from my phone.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:17.800
Ah, that's pretty unfortunate. Maybe they didn't survive the Taisha's censoring?

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.030
But I feel bad about losing them...

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:23.050
Ah... You probably had embarrassing pictures of you and Tougou on it, didn't you?

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:24.860
H-Hey! What are you saying?!

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:27.900
Well, that's something you can't
just tell anyone, right?

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:30.880
S-So, both of you are into
<i>that</i> kind of thing?

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.420
We're not!

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:54.260
<i>I saw the same thing... on Fuu-senpai.</i>

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.490
Oh, that's great!

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.330
But doing that outside isn't good for your throat.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:12.160
I can't wait for your event!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.300
I'll cheer you on.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:16.340
I already told you, it isn't my event.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:21.090
However... Thank you, I'll do my best.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.840
All right! That's my sister.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:28.460
All right, we're having something hot for dinner tonight. Let's stop by the supermarket.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.220
'Kay!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.990
Onee-chan!

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.290
Girls...

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.600
Yuuna-chan.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.300
How's Fuu-senpai?

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:05.740
She hasn't come out yet.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:25.670
Onee-chan!

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:28.660
Now I've done i-

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:30.700
Onee-chan!

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.390
Fuumin-senpai!
Fuu-senpai!
Fuu!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.100
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:39.650
He came right at me all of a sudden, you know?
He shouldn't have ignored the traffic signs.

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:40.650
But, but...

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.350
Itsuki...

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:48.110
Sorry for making you guys
come all the way here.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.180
Geez, you're such a troublemaker.

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:53.210
You could at least show a little more sympathy.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.230
Uhm, is it life-threatening?

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:58.540
There's no need to make a scene.
It's not that bad.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:01.400
But what a horrible thing to happen
to a student preparing for exams...

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.910
Please don't say that!

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.290
I'll take the test!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.500
I absolutely will!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:06.880
But you're bedridden, aren't you?

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.990
It's just for one or two weeks!

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:10.720
Please observe silence in the hospital!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:11.630
Sorry...

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.330
Are you her little sister?

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.590
Y-Yes.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:18.730
We need your assistance with filling out her admission paperwork. Will you accompany us?

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.160
Sure...

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:23.080
See ya! Thanks for coming!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.180
Observe silence!

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.930
I'm sorry...
Onee-chan! We're at the hospital...

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:27.780
That's it for now, I guess.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:30.600
Make sure you girls take care too, okay?

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.550
It's time for the alpha waves to come into play!

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:34.180
We're done with that already.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:36.030
Aww...

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:42.920
They won't get away with violating
traffic laws like this.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.420
It's good that her life isn't in danger.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.080
What was her fairy doing?

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:55.430
If any of you got hurt,
I wouldn't be able to stay calm.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.850
Tougou...

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:01.520
No more Kokubou Kamen or black
holes anymore, you hear?

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.690
Seriously, don't.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.570
Yuuna-chan, you too.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:07.570
Me?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.620
Try not to get hurt.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:10.940
Sure.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:13.160
Oh, the green's on.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:13.990
Later.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.290
See you tomorrow.
See you.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:17.120
Goodbye!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.120
Bye-bye!

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:57.570
<i>When I tried talking to everyone,
something bad happened to each of them.</i>

00:16:58.270 --> 00:17:02.290
<i>And then when I tried to explain everything to Fuu-senpai, she got into an accident.</i>

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:10.550
<i>The powers of the Heavens can
affect our real world, too.</i>

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:15.480
<i>Even if I try to change something, it will
just cause an effect somewhere else.</i>

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:18.010
<i>I guess that's how they're
balancing things out.</i>

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:23.890
<i>I mustn't tell anyone about what's happening to me.</i>

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:28.230
<i>If I break these rules,
everyone else will be in danger.</i>

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.860
<i>Our fight is already over.</i>

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:37.610
<i>We don't have to suffer anymore.</i>

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.120
<i>As long as I don't say anything,
everything will stay the same.</i>

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.800
<i>The fun days in the Hero Club will continue.</i>

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:48.880
<i>I can't involve anyone else in this.</i>

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.380
<i>As long as I keep quiet...</i>

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:56.970
<i>it will be fine.</i>

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.550
Itsuki, don't you have your
important event today?

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.280
It's all right.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.810
No, it's not.

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:20.770
I can't just have fun while you're
hurt and hospitalized, can I?

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.120
That just makes me more worried.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:26.410
You don't have to worry
about your big sister.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:31.520
I'm not having fun if you aren't.

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:33.500
So it's all right for today.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.430
I found someone to stand
in for me, so don't worry.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.650
You...

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:40.510
Injured people should just rest.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.400
Are you eating properly?

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:44.000
It's fine to order take-out.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.670
I make food myself!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:48.390
Well, mostly from the ready-made
stuff at the supermarket, though.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:51.220
You couldn't even make rice before.

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:55.430
That was ages ago!
I can do it now!

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.670
The mornings?

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.970
I wake up on time. I'm not
late for class or anything.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:05.240
Don't worry about the house.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.420
Itsuki, it's like you're the older sister now.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.800
Really? Nice!

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:14.720
What's so nice about that?

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:18.570
Geez...

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:19.510
Huh?

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:23.020
But thanks.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:30.450
When you get out, we definitely
have to do some fun things!

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:33.510
That's right! I'm looking forward
to New Year's Eve.

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:34.900
Yeah.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.640
This was one impressive year.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:41.740
Let's make the next one even more
impressive- in a good way.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:45.160
We did such a good job, after all.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:48.520
We all deserve to be happy.

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:54.470
You, Tougou, Karin, Sonoko,
and Yuuna are all really good girls!

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:57.670
As the club president,
I couldn't be happier!

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:05.930
Ah, it's a white Christmas.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.940
It really is.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.730
We're here for the injured person!

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:12.060
Sorry we're late, Itsuki-chan.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:18.260
You don't have to visit me this often.
And what's up with those clothes?

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:22.130
We thought you'd feel lonely spending
Christmas Eve alone in a hospital room.

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:25.760
I'm not feeling lonely!
At all! Absolutely not!

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:29.410
I'm sorry, she's actually really glad to see you.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.520
Wha-?! Itsuki!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:33.640
Huh? Where's Yuuna-chan?

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:35.790
We thought she'd already be here.

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:37.920
Eh?

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:00.000
What are we going to do when you
miss your entrance exams?

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.960
Hey! I can still make it!

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:05.010
So we're going to be in the same class next year?
Yuuna-chan, what happened to you?

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.240
Karin, you too?!

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:24.200
I think... I got it.
